-- SilAlt.df-- CedarChest 6.0 builds of Sil and the dependencies it was compiled-- against, for the version experiment in docs/sil-schematics-handoff.md.-- CedarChest 6.1 ships DFs for BiScrollers/ViewRec/PopUpButtons/Cursory-- but NO payload directories, so the mirror falls back to 6.0 and the-- install is a 6.1/6.0 hybrid -- which is what VersionMismatch reports.-- These are renamed with a 6 so they can sit beside the 6.1 files.Exports [Cedar]<CedarChest6.1>Top>  SilAlt.df!1                                  31-Jul-86 12:00:00 PDTExports [Cedar]<CedarChest6.1>SilAlt>  Sil6.bcd!1                                   07-May-86 10:35:28 PDT  ViewRecImpl6.BCD!1                           25-Apr-86 17:17:14 PST  MJSContainersImpl6.BCD!1                     25-Apr-86 15:18:43 PST  TypePropsImpl6.BCD!1                         03-May-85 17:42:52 PDT  AbuttersImpl6.BCD!1                          25-Apr-86 20:08:51 PST  sil.lb9!1                                    31-Jan-82 16:39:14 PST